+#!/usr/bin/env python3
+"""s231_tb_probe.py — Thunderbird Koin forensics at current main (9dafaadd).
+
+Runs the TB boot with the engine's env-gated map probes ON
+(MINIANDROID_MAPGET_TRACE + MINIANDROID_S173_PROBE) and extracts:
